# M2.2 — Capability audit substrate.
# One file per capability claim: capability_<technique>.available.md (H7 PASS)
# or capability_<technique>.gap.md (H7 FAIL → halt per §0.2 of mission brief).
# No retrofit clause (U-MISSION-D inheritance from K_0): a documented gap
# stops the mission; do not retrofit installs to recover lost capabilities.
